cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: UniDatabase
abstract: >-
  A database engine behind a backend-neutral typed API: connections, prepared
  statements, transactions, schema versioning and per-connection capability
  detection, reachable from Nim, from C and from Python. SQLite is the first
  backend.
type: software
